                                    </span>
                        <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text why-p"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">As a Tanzanian-owned company, we don’t just operate in Africa we live here. Our deep local knowledge, combined with years of safari experience across East and West Africa, means you’ll discover hidden gems, not just tourist spots.</span>
